WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.573
Drupal Canvas is where you build pages from components. This clip shows the main parts of the editor.

2
00:00:08.573 --> 00:00:38.053
The page you are building is in the middle. On the right, Page data holds the title, the address and the search settings.

3
00:00:38.053 --> 00:00:47.556
The Library on the left lists every component and pattern you can add. Type in the search box to find one.

4
00:00:47.556 --> 00:00:55.433
Click a component on the page to select it. Its settings open on the right, ready to change.

5
00:00:55.433 --> 00:01:02.388
Layers shows the outline of the page, so you can find and select any part of it.
